%% TMS — C4-style system context
%% Source of truth for the repository-level system context.
flowchart TB
    User["TMS User / Operator"]
    Auth0["Auth0\nAuthentication / Tenant Claim"]
    Web["TMS Web\nNext.js / Vercel"]
    API["TMS API\nNestJS / Vercel"]
    DB["PostgreSQL / Neon\nTenant-scoped persistence"]
    Worker["TMS Worker\nRailway"]
    ObjectStore["S3-compatible Object Store\nBackup artifacts"]
    External["External Webhook / Business Systems"]

    User -->|HTTPS / OIDC session| Web
    Web -->|OIDC / access token| Auth0
    Web -->|Authenticated API requests| API
    API -->|Verify issuer / audience / JWKS| Auth0
    API -->|Tenant context + transactions| DB
    API -->|Transactional outbox| DB
    Worker -->|Claim / process outbox and durable jobs| DB
    Worker -->|Signed webhook delivery| External
    Worker -->|Encrypted dump + checksum + manifest| ObjectStore
